 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Iblis, the angels, the Garden and Hell are never drawn; no plate in 43. «فاخرج منها» is not glossed with a place (Al-Muyassar says the Garden; As-Sa'di does not say). The day of 38 is not named (Al-Muyassar: the first blast; As-Sa'di does not say); 37-38 carry As-Sa'di's «وليس إجابة الله لدعائه كرامة في حقه… وإنما ذلك امتحان». 39:1-4 and 41 are not glossed (Iblis's «بما أغويتني»; the tafsirs' paraphrase of 41 is in Allah's first person). 42 is one chip so «ليس… إلا» stays whole. The hourglass and two paths start after «رب» (36:2, 39:2); the two paths live across the reciter's repeat of 39:5-8."
 },
